From e0be2b5dea6077890fecd726e80a5f90ad77b348 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:45:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] T71 F5: the set is bound in order, numbered, and proved
 on 3-7 Herbal Hill

wallSheets: wallDrawingSheets binds 00 cover (index, revisions, the first wall's
perspective fitted), 01 and 02 the plans, per wall the front view, the internal layout
and the sections, per wall the perspective, the visualisation, the cut list pages;
every sheet numbered NN / of with drawing number job-NN; titleFor reads
project.titleBlock (company, address, drawnBy, checkedBy, status, rev, date); the
worktops resolve from the design's records when the caller passes none; no cabinet
against a wall, no set. wallSetReport, wallSectionUnits and wallDrawingPages untouched.
The proof kitchen (test/fixtures/t71-herbal-hill.js) is read off Skylon's six sheets;
scripts/t71-render.mjs renders the set headless.
Tests: turn71-the-set (the zones, the scale, nothing leaves its zone, the strip, the
key plan, appliances by type, the chains and the collision rule, each dimension once
per home, the legs from the engine's shape, the plates from the drilling, the worktop
resolved, the plans, the sections, the perspective, the order and numbering, the cut
list's pagination, the visualisation's frame, the renderers). The T40, T41, T42 and
T43 set tests re-pinned to the set, each with the reason beside it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UMSCbqdi85whfyRQS2gqQ2
